OL,3,GNEWSACentenary cathedral concert to
OL,4,Aunite 100 voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 singers will take to the
OL,7,Fstage as part of a special concert
OL,8,Fcelebrating Blackburn Cathedral's
OL,9,Fcentenary.
OL,11,FPerformers from Local Vocals and
OL,12,FBlackburn's New Road Music Studios will
OL,13,Fcome together for the event.
OL,15,FThe 100 Voices for 100 Years concert
OL,16,Fwill feature contemporary choir
OL,17,Farrangements and operatic performances
OL,18,Fwhile also raising money for two local
OL,19,Forganisations.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
