OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACentenary cathedral concert to
OL,4,Aunite 100 voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterim Dean of Blackburn, Canon Andrew
OL,7,FHorsfall, said: "Bringing over 100
OL,8,Fvoices into this incredible space - and
OL,9,Fdoing so in support of both the work of
OL,10,Fthe cathedral and our friends at East
OL,11,FLancashire Hospice - will be deeply
OL,12,Fmoving."
